  data: {
    LLM: 'Deal 4 cards each. Optional Mus phase: all four may agree to discard one to four cards and receive replacements. Four betting rounds follow in order (Grande, Chica, Pares, Juego); mano may pass or bet; opponents may fold, see, or raise. Órdago stakes the whole game on one category. Showdown: compare hands in each category; first team to 40 points wins the game.',
    Player: 'Deal 4 cards each. Optional Mus phase: all four may agree to discard one to four cards and receive replacements. Four betting rounds follow in order (Grande, Chica, Pares, Juego); mano may pass or bet; opponents may fold, see, or raise. Órdago stakes the whole game on one category. Showdown: compare hands in each category; first team to 40 points wins the game.',
    objective: 'Be the first team to reach 40 points (winning a game). Win two games to win the match.',
    gameplay: 'Deal 4 cards each. Optional Mus phase: all four may agree to discard one to four cards and receive replacements. Four betting rounds follow in order (Grande, Chica, Pares, Juego); mano may pass or bet; opponents may fold, see, or raise. Órdago stakes the whole game on one category. Showdown: compare hands in each category; first team to 40 points wins the game.',
    keyRules: [
      'Four categories: Grande, Chica, Pares, Juego',
      'Mus allows card exchange before play',
      'Betting on each category in order',
      'Partners use secret signals',
      'First to 40 points wins the game',
